WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Today the words are mixed. Some have a silent e, and some do not.

2
00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.989
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:07.489 --> 00:00:11.868
This is the real skill. Your child has to check the end of every word.

4
00:00:12.318 --> 00:00:15.372
Before each word, your child points to the last letter.

5
00:00:15.872 --> 00:00:18.584
There is no e here. So the middle sound is short.

6
00:00:22.128 --> 00:00:23.143
The word is fin.

7
00:00:24.043 --> 00:00:26.921
Now the next word. Point to the last letter again.

8
00:00:27.421 --> 00:00:30.629
This one ends with the e. So the middle sound is long.

9
00:00:34.354 --> 00:00:35.446
The word is fine.

10
00:00:36.346 --> 00:00:40.518
Do the first row of job one together. Your child does the second row.

11
00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:45.367
If a word goes wrong, say the same words. Look at the end. Is there an e?

12
00:00:45.817 --> 00:00:48.867
For job two, press play for your child and step away.

13
00:00:49.317 --> 00:00:51.829
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
